# Lesson 1 on a DPR-3 phone by touch: the tray's Wallop button, a tap on the
# workshop mounts the piston aimed at the dummy, the ⚡ chip fires it; every
# lesson step advances and the lesson completes.
# viewport 390x844@3
frames 150
touch =Learn
frames 20
touch The Piston
frames 20
until 600 =Pause
frames 330
expect Select the Wallop Piston
save l-start
touch Wallop Piston, 1 available
frames 10
expect Place it on the glowing wall mount
touch 195 450
frames 10
save l-placed
touch =Trigger Wallop Piston
repeat 2000 until =🗺 Stages
frames 10
end
frames 30
save l-results
expect Next lesson
